  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## Nathalie Proche'   Travel Advisor\n\n![Nathalie headshot.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/570280_8a4c40eb70d7417ca089ec727a4f3133~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_219,h_298,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Nathalie%20headshot.jpg)\n\n[![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png)\\\\\n\\\\\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_ad00e9a4df534dccbc20a627b0861168~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_ad00e9a4df534dccbc20a627b0861168~mv2.png)\\\\\n\\\\\n![](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_25,h_25,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/035244_6af9c4421a85482ca71b02dc782a276a~mv2.png)](mailto:nathalie@reachmeetings.com)\n\nOffering 28 years of experience in administration, travel planning and customer relationship management in both Non-profit & Corporate sectors, along with 15 years in the hospitality industry, I represent a strong force of customer service support. My passion for planning affords me the opportunity to work with the best full meeting management team company across the globe.\n\n​\n\nAs a New Orleans native, southern hospitality is in my blood. A friendly, flavorful, fantabulous team player who just happens to be a Certified Customer Service Rep. Whoop Whoop!! During my downtime, trying new recipes (Cajun & Creole) to cook or simple crafting projects brings great joy and fulfillment.  I also enjoy spending time with my family and friends, catching up on a weekly show, and shopping of course.\n\n​\n\nMemberships include:\n\nInternational Administrative Assistant Professional (IAAP)\n\n- Texas/Louisiana Branch Member & Director Assistant\n\n\n- Branch Director, Plano, TX Chapter (2018-2021)\n\n- Collin College Boss Advisory Board\n\n- Board member (2019-Present)\n\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
