t,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">As a New Orleans native, southern hospitality is in my blood. A friendly, flavorful, fantabulous team player who just happens to be a Certified Customer Service Rep. Whoop Whoop!! During my downtime, trying new recipes (Cajun &amp; Creole) to cook or simple crafting projects brings great joy and fulfillment. &nbsp;I also enjoy spending time with my family and friends, catching up on a weekly show, and shopping of course.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Memberships include:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">International Administrative Assistant Professional (IAAP)</span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Texas/Louisiana Branch Member &amp; Director Assistant</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Branch Director, Plano, TX Chapter (2018-2021)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Collin College Boss Advisory Board</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-light,futura-lt-w05-light,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Board member (2019-Present)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><div id=\"soapAfterPagesContainer\" class=\"soapAfterPagesContainer page-without-sosp\"><div data-mesh-id=\"soapAfterPagesContainerinlineContent\" data-testid=\"inline-content\" class=\"\"><div data-mesh-id=\"soapAfterPagesContainerinlineContent-gridContainer\" data-testid=\"mesh-container-content\"><div id=\"comp-jpe7y5rm\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div id=\"comp-k35bvj3k\" class=\"MazNVa comp-k35bvj3k wixui-image rYiAuL\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.reachmeetings.com/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"j7pOnl\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" id=\"img_comp-k35bvj3k\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg\" alt=\"REACH logo\" style=\"object-fit:cover\" class=\"BI8PVQ Tj01hh\" width=\"240\" height=\"100\"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"SCROLL_TO_BOTTOM\" class=\"Vd6aQZ ignore-focus SCROLL_TO_BOTTOM\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"bottom of page\"